stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> board

  board: modeBoard (4-column kanban)
  drill: modeDrill (card detail)
  viewer: modeViewer (glamour / peek)
  sessions: modeSessions (NEW - the session panel)
  form: modeForm (huh - pickers and confirms)

  board --> drill: enter
  drill --> board: esc / q / left / h
  drill --> viewer: enter / v (open a file)
  viewer --> drill: esc / q

  board --> sessions: S
  drill --> sessions: S
  sessions --> board: esc / q (opened from the board)
  sessions --> drill: esc / q (opened from the drill)

  board --> form: m / M / d / x / a / K / P / R
  drill --> form: a / K / P / R
  sessions --> form: R (target select) / K (kill confirm)

  form --> board: finish or cancel (pickerOrigin = modeBoard)
  form --> drill: finish or cancel (pickerOrigin = modeDrill)
  form --> sessions: finish or cancel (pickerOrigin = modeSessions)

  note right of sessions
    lists EVERY live gogo-* session
    (m.sessionMeta - host-wide, not root-scoped)
    R re-assign - K close - cursor clamps
    on the 5s tick; no pipeline state written
  end note

  note right of form
    a new pending* path must be added in FIVE places:
    the field, the StateCompleted dispatch,
    cancelForm returnMode, cancelForm clear,
    formPreservesSelection
  end note
